rs, and furniture restyler Chloe Kempster is challenged to come up with a radical redesign for a loom chair and cabinet.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zHxjVF4Je2MWFKevjscO9uYcSAZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-19\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Moore and designers Leigh-Anne Treadwell and Duncan McKean revive some retro lampshades, two wingback armchairs and an extendable dining table.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/apPEe6yIggrcqyk98BkwXUzRnTy.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 13\",\"overview\":\"Jacqui Joseph and her team of creatives transform a retro cabinet, a pair of wardrobe doors and some dining chairs.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zCwvQENJ237wHZsfNg8uentgZYQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-23\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 14\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Moore calls on a blacksmith and an upholsterer to help her upcycle an armchair, a bed frame and some metal ladders.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q2goS6gXmg2vyrayHrzHPknqfLT.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-24\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 15\",\"overview\":\"Jay Blades and his team of designers breathe new life into some tired tables, chairs and metal gates salvaged from a recycling centre in Walsall.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vToIC9J3GiBjQMMeZ9uxW5qrBSe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-25\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 16\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Moore and her crafty creatives upcycle an antique desk and two barley twist chairs. Saraj also gets to work transforming some thrown-away grooming sets.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2ZK6iaTLEKNwBLk2jprKgz9dyIn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-26\",\"runtime\":43},{\"n